he o\nly identifiable object \(by the logistic carrier\) is the pallet not the parts while the company continues to know each component within the pallet, but, in standard transport only their global position is updated \(not in continuous way\).\r\rIn the pre\sent case of logistics the company that manages the transportation can know the position of the truck thanks to the GPS in the track\(\))/CreationDate(D:20170211150901+01'00')/F 28/M(D:20170212110901+01'00')/NM(f6b76e53-6311-4ab7-b376-ae45582b6756)/Name/Comment/P 66 0 R/Popup 1504 0 R/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:15.23.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-\weight:normal;font-style:normal">Not all the actors in the value chain have access to them \(some are manifest, some others not\). e.g. parts can be singularly known in the production process or internal logistic chain, but, when palletized and given to t\he external logistic chain, the only identifiable object \(by the logistic carrier\) is the pallet not the parts while the company continues to know each component within the pallet, but, in standard transport only their global position is updated \(not i\n continuous way\).&#13;&#13;In the present case of logistics the company that manages the transportation can know the position of the truck thanks to the GPS in the track\(\)</span></p></body>)/Rect[451.799 242.937 469.799 260.937]/Subj(Nota)/Subtype/Text/T(Gualtiero Fantoni)/Type/Annot>>endobj1507 0 obj<</AP<</N 1779 0 R>>/C[1.0 0.819611 0.0]/CreationDate(D:20170211150754+01'00')/F 4/M(D:20170211150754+01'00')/NM(56c777a8-6683-4466-99a2-e7ca35b36717)/P 61 0 R/Popup 1509 0 R/QuadPoints[204.718 399.732 356.423 399.732 204.718 385.519 356.423 385.519]/Rect[200.924 385.075 360.217 400.176]/Subj(Evidenziato)/Subtype/Highlight/T(Gualtiero Fantoni)/Type/Annot>>endobj15